"'sales/close-quarter'), combined with http_method to look up this endpoint "
"at call time. Must be unique across every custom endpoint, active or "
"archived."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_rest_api_endpoint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_rest_api_endpoint.field_ssi_rest_endpoint__handler_type
msgid ""
"What runs when this endpoint is called: a whitelisted model method (model_id"
" + method_name), or an ir.actions.server (server_action_id). Storing "
"arbitrary Python code on a field and executing it with safe_eval is "
"deliberately not an option here — see this module's Keputusan Desain."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_rest_api_endpoint
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_rest_api_endpoint.field_ssi_rest_endpoint__is_readonly
msgid ""
